ind":"update","title":"Release Schedule Update","summary":"Hello, this is developer PantsSmell.The official release of 'Who Am I' has been delayed from July to November.I am currently focusing entirely on polishing the game to ensure a much higher quality experience. Thank you for your patience and understanding. I will see you in November with a better game.Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T16:09:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592798936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3980550-1831432155563555","game_id":"steam-3980550","kind":"update","title":"v0.1.4 & v0.1.5 Patch Notes","summary":"Hello, I'm PantsSmell, the developer of Who Am I. Based on the valuable feedback and reviews we've received, we have released demo updates (v0.1.4 and v0.1.5).\\ 📌 Gameplay ImprovementsAdded a hint for the first padlock.Changed the activation timing for the second padlock hint: Previously, it was only activated after the time attack began, but it is now accessible from the start of the game.🔧 Bug FixesFixed a bug in Chapter 1 \\ where the diary note would disappear depending on the movement of the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T22:40:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155563555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3980550-1830163047261928","game_id":"steam-3980550","kind":"announcement","title":"Who Am I Demo Released!","summary":"My first indie horror game, \"Who Am I,\" was first released on April 16th!Developing it alone for about two years had its ups and downs, but I'm so glad to finally present this demo to you. \"Who Am I\" is a game where the protagonist faces various shocking truths revealed through recurring nightmares. I hope you feel immersed and enjoy the game as you uncover the protagonist's past and get closer to the truth. I will continue to work hard on development and improvements to achieve this! Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-18T07:10:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3980550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3980550":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3980550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z"},"4617030":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:27Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3980550","app_id":3980550,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8c289fa86ee0d6c28bcd6e9cc18172eebd5d5c5c4cd5c5a61bacafcb6107356c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"기억을 잃어버린 주인공이 되어, 악몽과 함께 되살아나는 참혹한 과거를 마주하세요. 일기장 깊숙이 숨겨진 진실을 파헤쳐야 합니다. 현실과 환각의 경계가 무너지는 심리적 공포 속에서, 광기에 삼켜지기 전 흩어진 기억의 파편을 맞춰야 합니다. 모든 진실이 드러났을 때, 스스로에게 질문하세요. 나는 누구였지?","publishers":[{"name":"PantsSmell"}],"developers":[{"name":"PantsSmell"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794463200,"is_coming_soon":true,"